cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PRISM in your work, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "PRISM: Pattern Recognition and Insight through Systemic Mapping"
abstract: >-
  PRISM is an open-source web tool that runs AI-assisted analysis on PubMed
  literature across five modules -- Absence Mapping, Tension Topology,
  Methodological Critique, Hypothesis Nudges, and Field Diagnostic -- to help
  researchers see not just what a body of literature reports, but what it is
  missing.
type: software
